  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EEM South Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The European Union intends to send an Electoral Expert Mission (EEM) to South Africa to collect factual information concerning the electoral process (Parliamentary Elections - 29 May). IOM will select 3 Experts (1 Team Leader/Electoral expert, 1 Political Expert and 1 Legal/Human Rights Expert), who will travel to South Africa from end of April to early June 2024, to meet all relevant stakeholders and produce a report. IOM will have no visibility and will not be associated in any way to the work of the experts; we will provide administrative, logistical and security support.</narrative>
  </description>
